  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_04_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Pun on Achillean heel,expression meaning where your weakness is",
    },
    "value": ""Lass dich von der achillischen Qualität bezaubern."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_05",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on the old "I can't believe it's not butter" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Can%27t_Believe_It%27s_Not_Butter!",
