    "value": ""Eine wunderschöne, weiße Tasche mit filigranen Verzierungen. Hat einen indischen Touch."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01",
    "value": "Trennmagnet",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " new: minor rephrasing",
    },
    "value": "Freigelegte Ressourcen werden zu dir hingezogen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Harry Potter pun on spell accio = fetch",
    },
    "value": ""Accio Material!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Norse God Freyr owned a ship that he could fold into his pocket when not needed",
    },
    "value": "Tasche des Freyr",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01_desc",
    "value": "Du kannst einen zusätzlichen Batzen Erz pro regulären Platz lagern.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Taken from norse mythology, The books of Snorri, The prose Edda, The poetic Edda.",
    },
    "value": ""Prosaisch, poetisch, pittoresk."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_gem_01",
    "value": "Doppeldepot",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_gem_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " new: rephrasing",
    },
    "value": "Du kannst zwei Edelsteine pro Platz lagern!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_gem_01_flavor",
    "value": ""Wenig Platz mit vielen Vorteilen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_money_01",
    "value": "Börsenexperte",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_money_01_desc",
    "value": "Wenn du eine Ressource wegwirfst, erhältst du einen Teil ihres geldlichen Wertes.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_money_01_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Lyrics From Sades song Smooth Operator",
    },
    "value": ""Sich zu verspekulieren zahlt sich in diesem Fall aus."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_health",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Pun on Elton john song circle of life meaning that everything goes around and comes back to life – from song circle of life, Recycle the present is just a quote on how recycling today will make the future a better place.",
    },
    "value": "Mehrweg Lebenszyklus",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_health_desc",
    "value": "Du kannst durch das Wegwerfen von Ressourcen ein wenig Gesundheit wiederherstellen. Edelsteine stellen mehr Gesundheit her als Erz.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_discard_give_health_flavor",
    "value": ""Recycle die Gegenwart, rette deine Zukunft."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_lower_death_penalty_01",
    "value": "Gnade des Sensenmanns",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_lower_death_penalty_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " new: minor rephrasing",
    },
    "value": "Du verlierst weniger Ressourcen, wenn du stirbst.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_lower_death_penalty_01_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Blue Öyster Cult cult classic song Don't fear the reaper",
    },
    "value": ""Keine Angst vorm Sensenmann!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_town_portal",
    "value": "Portal der Gnade",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_town_portal_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "El Machino is the name of the city",
    },
    "value": "Kehre sofort nach El Machino zurück ohne Ressourcen zu verlieren. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit im System-Reiter.\\n\\n{format bold}Funktioniert nicht in Höhlen und wenn du in Gefahr bist. Das Symbol der Fähigkeit {image town_portal_small} zeigt dir an, wenn sie verwendet werden kann.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_town_portal_flavor",
    "value": ""Du kannst behalten, was dir gehört."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_double_resources",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Famous Internet meme Double Rainbow https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQSNhk5ICTI",
    },
    "value": "Doppelter Regenbogen",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_double_resources_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "new: minor rephrasing",
    },
    "value": "Du hast eine Chance, zwei Ressourcen aus einem Ressourcenfeld zu erhalten.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_double_resources_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From meme double rainbow",
    },
    "value": ""Was wohl bei drei Regenbögen passiert wäre?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_pickup_money",
    "value": "Landstreicherkönig",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_pickup_money_desc",
    "value": "Erhalte Bares, jedes mal wenn du eine Ressource mit geringem Wert aufhebst. Je geringer der Wert, desto mehr Geld erhältst du. Funktioniert nicht bei Ressourcen über $7.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_pickup_money_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Quote from Tolkiens books, character Samwise Gamgee's line: It's like in the great stories, Mr. Frodo, the ones that really mattered.",
    },
    "value": ""Es ist wie in den großen Geschichten, Herr Landstreicher, den richtig zerfledderten."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_value",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Bruce Willis Line in Die Hard, yippie ki-yay combined with yuppie as in newly rich person that makes money",
    },
    "value": "Yuppie ay ey",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_value_desc",
    "value": "Erhalte 30%% mehr Geld beim Verkauf von Ressourcen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_backpack_extra_value_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Internet meme: http://knowyourmeme.com/memes/it-prints-money",
    },
    "value": ""Das Geld muss fließen!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor",
    "value": "Körperpanzerung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_desc",
    "value": "Panzerung beschützt dich vor den Gefahren der Tiefen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Verbessere die Panzerung um deine Lebenspunkte zu erhöhen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_01",
    "value": "Plattenrüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_01_desc",
    "value": ""Eine normale, Schutz bietende Rüstung. Nicht mehr und nicht weniger."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_02",
    "value": "Solide Rüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_02_desc",
    "value": ""Robuster als normale Rüstungen, ist aber immer noch bei den Einsteigermodellen anzusiedeln."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_03",
    "value": "Harte Rüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_03_desc",
    "value": ""Bietet in gefährlichen Umgebungen ausgezeichneten Schutz."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_04",
    "value": "Härtere Rüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_04_desc",
    "value": ""In der Beschreibung steht, sie sei einfach viel härter als eine harte Rüstung."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_05",
    "value": "Promi-Rüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_05_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From lyrics to song Fame from movie Fame",
    },
    "value": ""Ditmar Bowlen trägt sie meistens zu seiner Show "Tumbleton sucht den Superbot"."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_06",
    "value": "Doom-Rüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_06_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Doom game manual description of their armor and pun on title "knee-deep in the dead" – the first level from original Doom",
    },
    "value": ""Damit kannst du knallharten Dämonen super schnell hinterherjagen, sogar mit richtig dicken Wummen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_07",
    "value": "Vollmondrüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_07_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to Tom Petty's song "Won't back down" from album "Full Moon Fever"",
    },
    "value": ""Befindest du dich vor den Tore der Hölle, wird diese Rüstung nicht klein beigeben."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_08",
    "value": "Phönixrüstung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_08_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Thou – old english",
    },
    "value": ""Steh auf, schüttel die Asche von deinen Schultern und sei der neue Star."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Landing soft like the cougar feline",
    },
    "value": "Katzenhafte Reflexe",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01_desc",
    "value": "Reduziert deinen Fallschaden.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01_flavor",
    "value": ""Die Schwerkraft tanzt nach meiner Pfeife."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_thorns",
    "value": "Karmaplatten",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_thorns_desc",
    "value": "Fügt jedem Schaden zu, der dich im Nahkampf verletzt.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_thorns_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A power ballad song by band Poison",
    },
    "value": ""Keine Rose ohne Dornen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_guts",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A spoof on Hasselhoff's song True Survivor for short film Kung Fury",
    },
    "value": "Überlebenskünstler",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_guts_desc",
    "value": "Üblicherweise tödlicher Schaden setzt deine Gesundheit stattdessen auf das Minimum.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_guts_flavor",
    "value": ""Ob im Jungel, in der Wüste ... oder eben unter der Erde."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_resistliquids",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Vidar = The Norse God that slayed the Fenrir Wolf",
    },
    "value": "Vidarstiefel",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_resistliquids_desc",
    "value": "Stark genug, um selbst Säure und Lava zu widerstehen, benötigt das Material doch manchmal eine Auszeit.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_resistliquids_flavor",
    "value": ""Diese Schuhe sind zum Laufen gemacht. In Säure und Lava."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_damage_reduction",
    "value": "Kompositbeschichtung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_damage_reduction_desc",
    "value": "Reduziert deinen erlittenen Schaden.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_damage_reduction_flavor",
    "value": ""Das Maß aller Dinge in Sachen Körperpanzerung."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NEW* Song "As long as you love me" by Backstreet Boys. I don't care who you are, Where you're from, What you did, As long as you love me. The terms diversity, fluid and rainbow are used as an hommage to tolerance and the LGBTQ community.",
    },
    "value": "Kernvielfalt",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs_desc",
    "value": "Eine fluide Polychrompanzerung, die eine kleine Chance verleiht, dass Gegner, wenn sie besiegt werden, 3 Regenbogenkugeln hinterlassen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs_flavor",
    "value": ""Ihr ist egal wer du bist, wo du herkommst oder nach was du gräbst – solange du sie trägst."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_deflect",
    "value": "Aramidpanzerung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_deflect_desc",
    "value": "Wehrt das erste Projektil ab, das dich trifft. Hat eine Aufladezeit von 30 Sekunden.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_armor_deflect_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A riposte used when someone calls you a name. Indicates that whatever ... I'm rubber you're glue, your words bounce off me and stick to you. Also a nod to its usage in Monkey Island game series.",
    },
    "value": ""Ich bin der Gummi und du bist der Kleber."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank",
    "value": "Wassertank",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_desc",
    "value": "Viele deiner Werkzeuge benötigen Wasser, das du in Wassertaschen überall in der Mine auffüllen kannst.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Verbessere den Wassertank, um deine Wasserreserve zu vergrößern.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_01",
    "value": "Schlichter Krug",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_01_desc",
    "value": ""Der Eckpfeiler aller dampfbetriebenen Technologien."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_02",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Herman Melville - author of Moby Dick",
    },
    "value": "Melville Regulierer",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_02_desc",
    "value": ""Verleiht jeder aquatischen Technologie den letzten Schliff."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_03",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "The Notourious B.I.G. and his song Mo money Mo problems",
    },
    "value": "Die perfekte Welle",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_03_desc",
    "value": ""Hast dein Leben lang gewartet. Hast gehofft, dass es sie gibt."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_04",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Old band The Sisters of Mercy",
    },
    "value": "Zistern' die deinen Namen trägt",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_04_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "One of their songs",
    },
    "value": ""Wurde von Dr. N. Preschtnik erdacht und durch Dr. Ö. jr. sinnvoll weiterentwickelt."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_05",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Captain Nemo's submarine Nautilus",
    },
    "value": "Nautilus II",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_05_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on Jules Verne's book Twenty Thousand Leagues under the sea",
    },
    "value": ""Bietet Platz für bis zu zwanzigtausend Liter Wasser."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01",
    "value": "Regenmacher",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " new: minor rephrasing.",
    },
    "value": "Besiegte Gegner haben eine Chance, eine zusätzliche Wasserkugel zu hinterlassen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "BJ Thomas song Raindrops Keep falling on my head",
    },
    "value": ""Es will einfach nicht aufhören, dir aufs Dach zu regnen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Technotronics old song",
    },
    "value": "Schmeiß die Pumpe an",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump_desc",
    "value": "Wasser aus Reservoirs wird schneller angesaugt.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From the song Pump up the Jam",
    },
    "value": ""Mr. Pumpmann, einmal volltanken bitte!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_condenser",
    "value": "Luftentfeuchter",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_condenser_desc",
    "value": "Verwandelt Feuchtigkeit in fließendes Wasser und füllt deinen Wasservorrat regelmäßig auf.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_water_condenser_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Jimmy cliff song lyrics: I can see clearly now the rain is gone",
    },
    "value": ""Und ich frage mich noch immer: Wer wird den Regen stoppen?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water",
    "value": "Sturmjäger",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water_desc",
    "value": "Dieser Kondensator wandelt Lichtkugeln in Wasserkugeln. Wirkt nicht auf Regenbogenkugeln.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to the Bible where Jesus turned water into wine",
    },
    "value": ""Licht zu Wasser, Wasser zu Wein – der älteste Trick aus dem Buch."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_regeneration",
    "value": "Aquatische Genese",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_regeneration_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " new: minor rephrasing",
    },
    "value": "Regeneriere Leben, während du dich in Wasserpfützen befindest.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_watertank_regeneration_flavor",
    "value": ""Ein kleiner Schluck und schon geht's mir besser."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap",
    "value": "Karte",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_desc",
    "value": "Zeigt dir an, wo du schon warst, und wohin die Reise geht.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_01",
    "value": "Karte",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Quote from Earl Nightingale, american writer",
    },
    "value": ""Alles was du brauchst ist der Plan, die Straßenkarte und den Mumm, bis ans Ziel zu gelangen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " (Renamed)",
    },
    "value": "Kartenmarkierungen",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Text within { } should not be translated.",
    },
    "value": "Zeigt Markierungen ({image quest_pointer_arrow} und {image quest_pointer_crosshair}) auf deiner Karte zu deinen Questzielen.\\n\\n{format bold}Wenn du es vorziehst, ohne Hilfe zu erkunden, kannst du diese Rädchenmod deaktivieren.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A nod to Lemmy's Show and the character Falconhoof. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWmiShFb0go",
    },
    "value": ""So wie ein Adler seinen Klauen folgt, wird er dir den Weg auf deinen Abendteuern weisen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Nod to the Harry Potter Marauder's Map",
    },
    "value": "Karte des Kupfertreibers",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector_desc",
    "value": "Deckt alle Ressourcen auf der Minikarte auf.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Small pun on actor Roger Moore",
    },
    "value": ""Mehr Erze, mehr Spaß!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_hp_bar",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Odin – all-seeing father of norse mythology, quote is merely a question without reference, feel free to make it into your own languages equivalent",
    },
    "value": "Odins Blick",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_hp_bar_desc",
    "value": "Zeigt die feindlichen Lebenspunkte an, sobald du ihnen Schaden zugefügt hast.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_minimap_hp_bar_flavor",
    "value": ""Was liegt hinter dem geistigen Auge verborgen?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_run_boots",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*DEMO*",
    },
    "value": "Sprinthydraulik",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_run_boots_desc",
    "value": "Halte {indicator run} gedrückt, während du läufst, um zu rennen.\\nDurch rennen kannst du dich schneller bewegen und höher springen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_run_boots_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "I Blame Coco lyrics from song Quicker",
    },
    "value": ""Wären wir doch nur schneller, dann könnten wir die Zeit austricksen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_buddy",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Name",
    },
    "value": "Fen",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_buddy_desc",
    "value": "Eine mysteriöse, geisterhafte Erscheinung, die es sich in deinem Dampfkessel gemütlich gemacht hat.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate",
    "value": "Schicksalsapparat",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_desc",
    "value": "Mysteriöse Verbesserungen, die die Fügungen des Universums beeinflussen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Black Sabbath lyrics from song Symptom of the universe",
    },
    "value": ""Wissenschaftler zerbrechen sich bis heute ihr Köpfe darüber."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_bloodquest",
    "value": "{image danger}Bluttrip{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_bloodquest_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Blood Stone is a resource in the game. Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    },
    "value": "Du erhältst eine Prämie, aber zu einem Preis.\\nVerdoppelt die Chance, Blutsteine von Gegnern zu erhalten, aber verdoppelt auch den Schaden, den sie dir zufügen.\\n\\n{format bold}Das Aktivieren dieser Rädchenmod macht deine Mission um einiges schwerer. Sie wird nur Veteranen empfohlen.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_bloodquest_flavor",
    "value": ""Ein zweischneidiges Schwert im wahrsten Sinn."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_xpx2",
    "value": "{image danger}Sage des Adrenalinjunkies{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_xpx2_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    },
    "value": "Erhalte fürs Gegnerausschalten die doppelten Erfahrungspunkte. Allerdings werden Kugeln nur noch von Gegnern hinterlassen, die du kreativ oder via Boni ausschaltest.\\n\\n{format bold}Das Aktivieren dieser Rädchenmod macht deine Mission um einiges schwerer. Sie wird nur Veteranen empfohlen.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_xpx2_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Made up proverb",
    },
    "value": ""Aus nichts wird nichts."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_explosions",
    "value": "{image danger}Todplosionen{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_explosions_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    },
    "value": "Besiegte Gegner explodieren.\\n\\n{format bold}Das Aktivieren dieser Rädchenmod macht deine Mission um einiges schwerer.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_explosions_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Let there be light, from the bible",
    },
    "value": ""Explosionen! Wir brauchen mehr Explosionen!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_resource_exploder",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Criss-Cross is refering to that the adjacent tiles will break in a cross pattern. Totally krossed out is Rap duo Kriss-Kross debut album, so it's a pun on that, but with correct spelling with c, not k.",
    },
    "value": "Kreuzverbrennung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_resource_exploder_desc",
    "value": "Wenn Ressourcenfelder zerstört werden, entstehen zusätzliche Exposionen, die anliegenden Feldern Schaden zufügen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_resource_exploder_flavor",
    "value": ""Die ursprüngliche Inspiration für den beliebten Klassiker Bomberwoman."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Latin for Seal of Heaven and Hell",
    },
    "value": "Sigillum Caelum et Infernum",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil_desc",
    "value": "Nahe am Höhepunkt der Einsamkeit\\nDie Umarmung einer jaulenden Wüste\\nIm Himmel wirst du deine Bestimmung finden\\nAn einem wundersamen und wunderschönen Ort",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Nod to Twin Peaks: Fire Walk With Me, meaning that you invite the devil to join you. Fate walk with me implies that you invite fate into your life.",
    },
    "value": ""Schicksal, zieh mit mir!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack",
    "value": "Düsenantrieb",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_desc",
    "value": "Halte {indicator jump} gedrückt, um zu fliegen.\\n Dieses experimentelle Dieseltriebwerk verbraucht zwar kein Wasser, überhitzt allerdings schnell.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Verbessere den Düsenantrieb, um es länger verwenden zu können.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_01",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Rocketeer comic origin 1939, character Cliff Secord",
    },
    "value": "Secord Mod. 38",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_01_desc",
    "value": ""Ein handelsübliches Vierzylinder-Reihentriebwerk."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_02",
    "value": "Doppelter Zyklon",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_02_desc",
    "value": ""Luftgekühlt und total stylish."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_03",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to a French WW1 engine.",
    },
    "value": "Le Rhône 69",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_03_desc",
    "value": ""Kombinierte Wasser- und Luftkühlung. Alles oder nichts, Schätzchen, alles oder nichts."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_slayer",
    "value": "Sputnik",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_slayer_desc",
    "value": "Wenn du mit dem Düsenantrieb aufwärts fliegst, werden alle Gegner und schwachen Felder, mit denen du in Kontakt kommst, zerstört.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_slayer_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to Eric Clapton song Grand Illusion",
    },
    "value": ""Keiner kann mir trotzen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_feather_fall",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " References is to song Falling by Julee Cruise, and song line Don't let yourself be hurt this time.",
    },
    "value": "Reisekontrolle",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_feather_fall_desc",
    "value": "Halte {indicator jump} gedrückt, wenn der Düsenantrieb überhitzt, um deinen Fall zu verlangsamen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_feather_fall_flavor",
    "value": ""Verletze dich nicht schon wieder dabei!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_boost",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Quote from character Maverick from movie Top Gun. Maverick Afterburner is also a reference to the character played by Tom Cruise.",
    },
    "value": "Draufgängernachbrenner",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_boost_desc",
    "value": "Erhöht die Geschwindigkeit deines Düsenantriebs. Zurücklehnen und genießen!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_boost_flavor",
    "value": ""Bis ans Limit. Das ist mein Motto."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NEW* Eastbound and down is a song from the movie "Smokey and the Bandit" Cletus Snow is a character from the movie, and his dog's name is Fred.",
    },
    "value": "Luftkühlung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling_desc",
    "value": "Lasse in der Luft {indicator jump} los, um den Jetpack abzukühlen. Vertrieb durch Snow & Fred GmbH.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling_flavor",
    "value": ""Für die unendliche Reise."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb",
    "value": "Druckbombe",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_desc",
    "value": "Kann nach vorne, oben oder unten geworfen werden. Verbraucht Wasser.\\nDrücke {indicator tool_pressurebomb}, um sie zu werfen!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Verbessere die Druckbomben, um sie weiter werfen zu können.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_01",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Osmotic= water pressure terminology",
    },
    "value": "Osmotischer Ticker",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A small refernence, mid-range migraine, to song The Message by Grandmaster Flash and the Furious Five",
    },
    "value": ""Hoher Druck bedeutet große Zerstörungskraft und eine mittlere Migräne."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_02",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Per Scholander= physiologist renowned for pressure bomb technology",
    },
    "value": "Scholander-Hydrostatik",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_02_desc",
    "value": ""Wirf diesen unter Druck stehenden Albtraum deiner Gegner noch weiter!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_03",
    "value": "Säurebombe",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_03_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to Scooter song Acid Bomb",
    },
    "value": ""Na Bombie-Bombie, komm her Bombie-Bombie, braves Bömbchen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_04",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NEW* Reference: Song Who Put The Bomp by Barry Mann: "Who put the bomp in the bomp bah bomp bah bomp / Who put the ram in the rama lama ding dong / Who put the bop in the bop shoo bop shoo bop / Who put the dip in the dip da dip da dip." =So now you can throw the bomb further = bomb bah LONGA' =longer",
    },
    "value": "Haftbombe TX Deluxe",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_04_desc",
    "value": ""Zerstören - Doch es darf nicht mir gehören."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker",
    "value": "Panzerknacker",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker_desc",
    "value": "Füge deinen Druckbomben mehr Durchschlagskraft hinzu, um noch härteres Gestein zu zerbrechen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Ghostbusters pun - When there's something strange in the neighbourhood, who ya gonna call",
    },
    "value": ""Das Tragen von Ohrstöpseln wird wärmstens ans Herz gelegt."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher",
    "value": "Granatenwerfer",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher_desc",
    "value": "Halte {indicator tool_pressurebomb} gedrückt, um eine zerstörerische Granate in einem Bogen abzufeuern.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Billy Ray Cyrus song Achy breaky heart",
    },
    "value": ""Du hast'n Pulsschlag aus Stahl."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_improved_water",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED*",
    },
    "value": "Sparfuchs",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_improved_water_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED*",
    },
    "value": "Der Wasserverbrauch wird um die Hälfte reduziert.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_improved_water_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED* Biblical referense to Moses",
    },
    "value": ""Wer spart, der hat."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_water_pickup",
    "value": "Aquabombe",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_water_pickup_desc",
    "value": "Durch Druckbomben zerstörte Felder hinterlassen eine zusätzliche Wasserkugel.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_water_pickup_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Reference to band Wet Wet Wet and their song Love is all around",
    },
    "value": ""Wasser gibt es überall."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_increased_radius",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED*",
    },
    "value": "Druckverstärker",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_increased_radius_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED*",
    },
    "value": "Die Detonationswelle der Druckbombe schädigt Gegner auf größere Distanz.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_increased_radius_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NOT CURRENTLY USED* Chris Cornell song wave Goodbye",
    },
    "value": ""Manchmal muss man einfach mehr Druck auf seine Umgebung ausüben, damit die Dinge laufen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_self_immunity",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Molotov Cocktail",
    },
    "value": "Molotov-Impfung",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_self_immunity_desc",
    "value": "Druckbomben fügen dir keinen Schaden mehr zu.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_self_immunity_flavor",
    "value": ""Wie man Problemen aus dem Weg geht? Immer schön Impfen lassen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher_triple",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " ThreeForce is a reference to the Legend of Zelda TriForce, The quote is just a rhyme and not important.",
    },
    "value": "Dreifache Sprenggranate",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher_triple_desc",
    "value": "Nach dem Aufladen, um eine Druckgranate abzufeuern, werden stattdessen 3 Granaten geworfen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_launcher_triple_flavor",
    "value": ""Drei Granaten bedeuten den dreifachen Spaß!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_air_bomb",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Norman Greenbaum song lyrics Spirit in the sky, pun on somebody being a mean spirit = bad and mean to people.",
    },
    "value": "Luftangriff",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_air_bomb_desc",
    "value": "Erlaubt es dir, während des Fluges Druckbomben zu verwenden. Achte auf den nötigen Sicherheitsabstand!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_pressurebomb_air_bomb_flavor",
    "value": ""Mach es wie der mächtige Spat – erhebe dich in die Lüfte und lasse es regnen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer",
    "value": "Presslufthammer",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_desc",
    "value": "Ein bemerkenswertes Werkzeug, um harte Materialien zu zerbrechen, ist jedoch ineffektiv gegen Gegner. Benötigt Wasser. Halte {indicator tool_jackhammer} gedrückt, um richtig Dampf zu machen!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Verbessere den Presslufthammer, um seine Effizienz beim Graben zu erhöhen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_01",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Peter Gabriels song Sledgehammer",
    },
    "value": "Gabriels Hammer",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_01_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Peter Gabriels song Sledgehammer - I want to be your sledgehammer",
    },
    "value": ""Er möchte dein ganz persönlicher Presslufthammer sein!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_02",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Titans=Mythological adversaries to the gods",
    },
    "value": "Bohrer der Titanen",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_02_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Removed MC Hammer reference",
    },
    "value": ""Verbesserte Effizienz bedeutet weniger Verbrauch bei gesteigertem Abbauvolumen."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_03",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Rocky 4 - Character Ivan Drago",
    },
    "value": "Der "Ivan Drago" Nr. IV",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_03_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "His signature phrase "I must break you"",
    },
    "value": ""Die Spitze wurde mit Wolframcarbid verstärkt und hat richtig Wumms. Schnapp dir 'n Ivan Drago!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_04",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "In norse mythology Mjölnir is the hammer of the mighty Thor",
    },
    "value": "Mjöllnir-Kraftpaket",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_04_desc",
    "value": ""Kosmos und Chaos ziehen dich in ihren Bann."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_improved_water",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Jab - to punch NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": "Trockenlager",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_improved_water_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": "Der Wasserverbrauch wird um die Hälfte reduziert.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_improved_water_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": ""Ziemlich heiß, aber die trockene Art von Hitze."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_windup",
    "value": "Synthetischer Schmierstoff",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_windup_desc",
    "value": "Verbessert die Anlaufzeit des Presslufthammers.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_windup_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Frankie goes to Hollywood song Relax",
    },
    "value": ""Ratatazong ratatazong und weg ist der Balkon."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_maxspeed",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Tribute to band KLF - also known as the Justified Ancients of Mu Mu",
    },
    "value": "Hochgeschwindigkeitszylinder",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_maxspeed_desc",
    "value": "Verbesserte pneumatischer Zylinder. Erhöht die maximale Betriebsgeschwindigkeit auf Kosten eines höheren Wasserverbrauchs.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_faster_maxspeed_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Their tune Last train to Trancentral",
    },
    "value": ""Er nannte seinen Presslufthammer B-B-B-Bernd."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_push",
    "value": "Staubstrudel",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_push_desc",
    "value": "Zieht dich vorwärts, wann immer der Presslufthammer einen Durchbruch erzielt.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_push_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Dolly Parton and Kenny Rodgers song Islands in the stream lyrics",
