      "raw": "*DEMO*",
    },
    "value": "Trashium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_trashium_desc",
    "value": "Simply put, scrap metal that's been welded together by the force of nature.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_copper",
    "value": "Copper",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_copper_desc",
    "value": "The high strength and low resistance of copper combine to make it an efficient and reliable electricity conductor.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_cinnabar",
    "value": "Cinnabar",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_cinnabar_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Vermillion is a scarlet pigment made of Cinnabar, expression "you look like a million dollars"",
    },
    "value": "A bright and toxic mercury sulfide mineral, historically used as a pigment. Will make you look like a Vermillion dollars!",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_ironium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Like irony",
    },
    "value": "Ironium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_ironium_desc",
    "value": "Relatively soft in its purest form, but bring the heat and it hardens significantly.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_cornflorium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From cornflower blue, color from the flower",
    },
    "value": "Cornflorium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_cornflorium_desc",
    "value": "Rare in the wild. Popular among graphical artisans in the nether Netherlands, due to its beautiful bluish blush.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_obsidian",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on Yngwie Malmsteen - swedish famous guitarr virtuoso",
    },
    "value": "Yngwium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_obsidian_desc",
    "value": "A real virtuoso ore from the Malmsteen magmatic family tree.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_silver",
    "value": "Silver",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_silver_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Werewolves are best killed with silver",
    },
    "value": "The one thing that'll help when hordes of werewolves invade your backyard. And they will, it's just a matter of time.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_zoinkonium",
    "value": "Zoinkonium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_zoinkonium_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on video game company Zoink and their titles Zombie Vikings and Stick it to the man",
    },
    "value": "A faint yet sticky smell of mead surrounds this rather simple but colorful lump.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_gold",
    "value": "Gold",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_gold_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "connectors = gold are used in technology",
    },
    "value": "A royal metal that leaves diggers and miners feverish for more. The choice of investors and connectors since 3000 BC.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_lazurite",
    "value": "Lazurite",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_lazurite_desc",
    "value": "A brittle mineral highly regarded for its use as pigment in painting and dyeing.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_saturnium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Saturnus, god of fertility",
    },
    "value": "Saturnium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_saturnium_desc",
    "value": "Believed by farmers to have a favorable impact on the harvest, hence placed along the fields during sowing season.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_plutonium",
    "value": "Plutonium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_plutonium_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Shiner Wars is an old conflict preceeding the game story, Pluto = disney dog",
    },
    "value": "A chemical element widely used in the windup to the Great Shiner Wars. Eventually tipped the scale in nobody's favor. Contrary to popular belief, not named after a popular dog.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_meteorum",
    "value": "Meteor Rock",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_meteorum_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Nod to Game Maniac Mansion and the antagonist Dr Fred Edison, also the game creators Gilbert and Winnick",
    },
    "value": "First found near a mansion on the corner of Gilbert and Winnick.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_unobtainium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Just a spoof on the word unobtainable",
    },
    "value": "Unobtainium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_unobtainium_desc",
    "value": "Since nobody ever expected to obtain it, there's really no data to be had. Sorry.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_darkmatter",
    "value": "Dark Matter",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_darkmatter_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Play with mothers comments on dating bad boys",
    },
    "value": "The matter your mother always warned you about. Can often be found hanging around dive bars and... oh wait... my mistake.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_sodium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": "Sodium",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_sodium_desc",
    "value": "Regular contact with its soft, silvery white dust can cause rapid dehydration.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_aluminium",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": "Aluminum",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_aluminium_desc",
    "value": "Both the most abundant and widespread metal on the planet. Perfect for making containers of traditional human beverages.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_beryl",
    "value": "Beryl",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_beryl_desc",
    "value": "Believed to transform dreams and wishes into reality, and to eliminate negative energies.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_azurite",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Azurite just sounds like these two expressions put together – Do as you want with this :)",
    },
    "value": "Azurite",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_azurite_desc",
    "value": "A combination of "As you were" and "You're right".",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_tremolite",
    "value": "Tremolite",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_tremolite_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Dr Dre = music producer and rapper – Dr Tre is a made up brother to make a pun on the resource name – mole pun molite",
    },
    "value": " The secret lovechild of Dr. Dre's brother Dr. Tre and a mole.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_topaz",
    "value": "Topaz",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_topaz_desc",
    "value": "Engulfs the surroundings with a radiant vibe of communication and care. The purple variety is extremely rare.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_ametrine",
    "value": "Ametrine",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_ametrine_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "The spanish queen was said to have been given an ametrine stone as gift from the first batch leaving the mines",
    },
    "value": "A rare stone rumored to hold strange powers. The biggest specimen is reputedly buried beneath the tomb of a Spanish queen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_diamond",
    "value": "Diamond",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_diamond_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Margareth Thatcher was chosen for her reputation as cold hearted – feel free to exchange for other politician of your country!",
    },
    "value": "The original classic, hard and cold as a hug from Margaret Thatcher. Regardless of gender, it's forever your best friend.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bismuth",
    "value": "Bismuth",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bismuth_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Bismuth sounds a bit like Bismarck, thats why the pun is on German Otto Bismarck, but if the mineral is named something else in your country, feel free to pun away :) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otto_von_Bismarck",
    },
    "value": "Discovered around 1400 AD by mysterious alchemists. Often sadly mistaken for lead or a German Fürst and Reichskanzler.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_imagenite",
    "value": "Imagenite",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_imagenite_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A pun on song from John Lennon Imagine – imagine there's no heaven, and no religion too",
    },
    "value": "Disputed among miners; does it really exist? Imagenite there's no Heavenite, and no Religionite too.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_amethyst",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "NOT CURRENTLY USED",
    },
    "value": "Amethyst",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_amethyst_desc",
    "value": "Its shine will soothe your sorrows, stimulate your emotions and lead you straight to another pursuit for everlasting love.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_blooddrop",
    "value": "Blood Drop",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_blooddrop_desc",
    "value": "Concentrated heliotropic anger from half-light creatures.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bloodstone",
    "value": "Blood Stone",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bloodstone_desc",
    "value": "This heliotrope restores mental clarity to its holder.",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bloodrock",
    "value": "Blood Rock",
  },
  {
    "key": "resource_bloodrock_desc",
    "value": "Coagulated fear and ill intentions. Sharpens the senses but blurs the mind's eye.",
  },
  {
