  {
    "key": "collectible_amulet",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Boom boxx song "Balla da li"",
    },
    "value": "Amulet of Baal Ahdahli-Dihla",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_amulet_desc",
    "value": "Obviously more potent than a lucky clover or a rabbit's foot. The eyes are glowing eerily and it's beginning to feel a bit warm. Is that a faint chanting emerging from its innards?",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_amulet_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iVC6nlhU4-E Phrase from song",
    },
    "value": ""Shalalala-la."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cereal",
    "value": "Bowl of Cereal",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cereal_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Jurassic Park 2 - The lost world",
    },
    "value": "Once the most important meal of the day. Now, the dried remains of a lost world.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cereal_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Winston Churchill quote "History will be kind to me for I intend to write it."",
    },
    "value": ""History will be kind to me for I intend to eat it."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dead_rat",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Latin for a rat type",
    },
    "value": "Rattus norvegicus",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dead_rat_desc",
    "value": "Living so close to humans, you'd think they were cousins. Sporting an amazing learning capacity, one even got elected prime minister of Norway.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dead_rat_flavor",
    "value": ""If you are what you eat, then I only want to eat the good stuff."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fertilizer",
    "value": "Fertilizer",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fertilizer_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "It's poop.",
    },
    "value": "Whatever fleshy creature left this jewel of a heap must've had a full-course dinner. Reeking of spicy herbs, perhaps from Provence.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fertilizer_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Bowel movements.",
    },
    "value": ""What goes around comes around."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_scented_candle",
    "value": "Scented Candle",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_scented_candle_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "http://www.ucl.ac.uk/archaeology/boneview/Interactive%20Components/Mammalian%20Skeleton/Elements/Skull/oviscapralateral.html",
    },
    "value": "The prominent shape of a Capra skull. Emitting an aroma of fear, imminent destruction and... sniff sniff... is that vanilla?",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_scented_candle_flavor",
    "value": ""The urge to destroy is also a creative urge."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wrapped_gift",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Schrödinger's cat https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_cat",
    },
    "value": "Schrödinger's What?",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wrapped_gift_desc",
    "value": "Oh la la! Anything could be inside this neatly wrapped package. Maybe a doll, a football, or nothing but a shape and variation in the structure of space.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wrapped_gift_flavor",
    "value": ""What's in the box?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_holy_toast",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Expression "Holy... and then anything" Like Holy Moly!",
    },
    "value": "Holy Toast",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_holy_toast_desc",
    "value": "You know how the Universe sometimes tries to send us subtle messages through the most mundane of commodities? This is not one of those objects.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_holy_toast_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on all things bread = BREADy, SOUR = sour dough, DONUT, LOAF = loaf of bread",
    },
    "value": ""Bready for a sourprise? Donut talk to me, loaf me alone."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lime_snowman",
    "value": "Lime Snowman",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lime_snowman_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on song White Christmas",
    },
    "value": "Iii'm dreaming of a liiime Christmaaas...",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lime_snowman_flavor",
    "value": ""Fresh as a morning cocktail and as clean as green."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_inflatable_friend",
    "value": "Inflatable Friend",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_inflatable_friend_desc",
    "value": "Loneliness is being the only one at a cuddle party.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_inflatable_friend_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Lyrics from Celine Dion song All by myself",
    },
    "value": ""When I dial the telephone, nobody's home."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_book_groda",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Groda = Frog in Swedish",
    },
    "value": "Dr. Groda Children's Book",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_book_groda_desc",
    "value": "Aah, good old Dr. Groda! Always with an instructional view on life's hardships.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_book_groda_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Frogret is a frog pun on word forget.",
    },
    "value": ""Froget your worries and enjoy good health."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_birdie_seeds",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "From Peter Sellers movie "The Party"",
    },
    "value": "Birdie Num Num Seeds",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_birdie_seeds_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Peter Sellers",
    },
    "value": "Famous for turning each feeding into a party. With these rare delicacies it's really a seller's market.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_birdie_seeds_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on old adverb A bird in the hand is worth two in the bush = what you got is more worth than what you don't have",
    },
    "value": ""A bird in the hand is worth nothing unless somebody wants to buy it."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_straw_doll",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Woodoo Doll",
    },
    "value": "Acupuncture Straw Doll",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_straw_doll_desc",
    "value": "Impressive handiwork! The irregular red paint really makes it come alive.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_straw_doll_flavor",
    "value": ""Crafting can be very good for your well-being."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_glowing_goo",
    "value": "Glowing Goo",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_glowing_goo_desc",
    "value": "This looks so out-of-this-world slimy, so resist any urge to put it in your mouth.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_glowing_goo_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Web series.",
    },
    "value": ""Steve, don't eat it!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lost_penguin",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Just a lost lonely penguin that has a photo of his missing loved one. Name shortened from last iteration",
    },
    "value": "Photo of a Missing Love",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lost_penguin_desc",
    "value": "It's hard to jump and dance for joy when you're lost and your love is nowhere near.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_lost_penguin_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "True nature fact",
    },
    "value": ""A penguin's love lasts forever."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_old_invitations",
    "value": "Old Unopened Invitations",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_old_invitations_desc",
    "value": "Hopes and dreams; conceived, chronicled and left to decay in the arms of oblivion.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_old_invitations_flavor",
    "value": ""Let it enfold you."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_sacred_documentation",
    "value": "Sacred Documentation",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_sacred_documentation_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Celebration of the old hit tv series "Dallas"",
    },
    "value": "Moving images that defined the future of pop culture for generations.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_sacred_documentation_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Character Bobby Ewing, dead since last season, appears in the shower = last season was just a dream.",
    },
    "value": ""The hardest plots of life can all be solved with a shower."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_chainsaw",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on popular brand Hello Kitty, Katze = Cat in german",
    },
    "value": "Hallo Katze Chainsaw",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_chainsaw_desc",
    "value": "A very popular brand, and one of many items in their series of Texas-style accessories.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_chainsaw_flavor",
    "value": ""Unchain someone else's heart."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_toy_rocket",
    "value": "Toy Rocket",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_toy_rocket_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Song reference: Moon River by Henry Mancini",
    },
    "value": "Follow the moon rivers with a huckleberry friend.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_toy_rocket_flavor",
    "value": ""Who knows what's waiting 'round the bend?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_monster_plushy",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Chtuhlu reference",
    },
    "value": "Monster Face Plushy",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_monster_plushy_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "A referense to Chtuhlu,HP Lovecrafts mythical creation",
    },
    "value": "A sleepy-time kiddy plushy. Hmm, the choking hazard warning seems to be written in Sumerian, Egyptian, Akkadian and a bunch of other ancient languages.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_monster_plushy_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "In his house at R'lyeh dead Cthulhu waits dreaming = translation from Lovecrafts fictional language",
    },
    "value": ""Ph'nglui mglw'nafh Cthulhu R'lyeh wgah'nagl fhtagn."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_shark_tooth",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Ginsu sharks lived around 80 million years ago.",
    },
    "value": "Ginsu Shark Tooth",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_shark_tooth_desc",
    "value": "Fierce to behold. Tricky to clean.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_shark_tooth_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Calcium, like in teeth and bone",
    },
    "value": ""A dentist's calcified dream."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_rubber_chickens",
    "value": "Bag of Rubber Chickens",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_rubber_chickens_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun: Why did the chicken cross the road? Hence crossroads",
    },
    "value": "Escaping this bag is a cacophony of cackles, clang and clamor composed by simple three-part harmonies. The ruckus seems to be at a crossroads.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_rubber_chickens_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on expression Like poetry to my ears.",
    },
    "value": ""Like poultry to my ears."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cake",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on the Cake from game Portal",
    },
    "value": "Cake",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cake_desc",
    "value": "Truth of the day: There's nothing like a good cake.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cake_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Lyric from Celebration by kool and the gang",
    },
    "value": ""Bring your good times and your laughter too."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_banana_peels",
    "value": "Preserved Banana Peels",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_banana_peels_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Expression that's just bananas - that's just crazy",
    },
    "value": "Someone actually preserved the peels? That's just bananas.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_banana_peels_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun: Fruit flies - they like bananas. If impossible to translate - make up something completely different :)",
    },
    "value": ""Time flies like an arrow and fruit flies like a banana."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_theremin",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "The musical instrument",
    },
    "value": "Theremin",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_theremin_desc",
    "value": "The future of electronica is here! Wave your hand to raise the haunting feeling that somewhere, someone has fallen into a deep well and needs help. Come to think of it, it looks like nobody's touched it for a long, long time.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_theremin_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Its original selling text when it was modern!",
    },
    "value": ""Won't make you sound like an opera star."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_weird_stone",
    "value": "Weird-Looking Stone",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_weird_stone_desc",
    "value": "An interesting shape that pulls your mind towards either an imploding nebula or a chanting choir.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_weird_stone_flavor",
    "value": ""When you can't hit the right notes, blame the stars."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_action_figure",
    "value": "Ninja Cat Action Figure",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_action_figure_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Tennage mutant ninja turtles spoof: Meow-Taunt = Mutant, then Vanilla Ice lyrics "Go Ninja Go Ninja Go" from song Ninja Rap",
    },
    "value": "Feel the franchise hype and join in the Teenage Meow-taunt: Go Ninja Cat, Go Ninja Cat - GO!",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_action_figure_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "April O'Neill character spoof from Turtles",
    },
    "value": ""Set for an April release."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fossil",
    "value": "Fossil",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fossil_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "See Vectron",
    },
    "value": "The electrical presence of Vectron has had an unexpected impact on both living and fossilized creatures of the depths.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fossil_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on pre-historical",
    },
    "value": ""Archaeology sure is groundbreaking! Is it just me, or are these puns pre-hysterical...?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_diary",
    "value": "Spelunky Diary",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_diary_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "See Archaea.",
    },
    "value": "The journal of Bree-Anne C G Gearson, a deep-drilling expert who's ventured into the darkest corners of Archaea. It mentions a shortage of brave aspirants for extending the excavations into deeper territories. Although fully illustrated with what must be fingerpaint, the tone of the log is somewhat melancholic and bitter.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_diary_flavor",
    "value": ""When you dig into an abyss, the abyss also digs into you."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fifty",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Book Fifty Shades of Gray",
    },
    "value": "Fifty Shades of Cliché",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fifty_desc",
    "value": "A dehydrated story filled with flat, monotonous grey matter.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_fifty_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun of passage from the book: "Why don't you like to be touched" Ana whispered, staring up into soft grey eyes. "Because I'm fifty shades of fucked-up, Anastasia"",
    },
    "value": ""'Why don't you like this book?' Bland whispered, staring up into watery dull eyes. 'Because I'm fifty shades of fed up, Blandastasia.'"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wagon_wheel",
    "value": "Wagon Wheel",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wagon_wheel_desc",
    "value": "Through wind and rain, many southbound small-town bots defied their fears. Most of these big-city dreams of fortune and glory ended up unfulfilled, buried beneath the burning dunes of the West Desert.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_wagon_wheel_flavor",
    "value": ""The way of the pioneer is always rough."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_black_box",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Like a plane's black box.",
    },
    "value": "Rocket Black Box",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_black_box_desc",
    "value": "The nationwide network of rocket enthusiasts, essentially an organization of brainiac know-it-alls, will hopefully benefit from this data.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_black_box_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "An aeroplane's "black" box is typically orange even though.",
    },
    "value": ""Yes wise guy, it's orange."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_red_cloth",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Nod to Character Rusty from Steamworld Dig",
    },
    "value": "Piece of Red Cloth",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_red_cloth_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Western, as in from The Wild West.",
    },
    "value": "Rugged and tightly woven, must have torn in some intense struggle. Looks like typical Western neckwear.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_red_cloth_flavor",
    "value": ""Pioneers are much like turtles, making grand progress when they stick their necks out."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cult_list",
    "value": "Doom Cult To-Do List",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cult_list_desc",
    "value": "Find divine entity of destruction – Check\\nExplain cult's organization chart – Check\\nReplace vaporized members of the committee – Check\\nListen to entity's demands – Check\\nDecapitate old statue – Check\\nBuy milk – ?\\nEstablish pilgrimage – Check\\nPrepare for end of the world – In progress",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_cult_list_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "First line of lyrics from Johnny Cash's song The Man comes around. Also in the bible.",
    },
    "value": ""And I heard, as it were the noise of thunder."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_amiigo",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on Amiibo, line of Nintendo toys",
    },
    "value": "Amiigo Figurine",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_amiigo_desc",
    "value": "Only those highly revered among the temple priests were allowed to lend their visage to the ancient craftsmen and holy sculptors. This, er... glorious action figure must indeed represent a truly worshipped and supreme being.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_amiigo_flavor",
    "value": ""WARNING: CHOKING HAZARD – figurine contains a certain air of pompousness."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_stone_tablet",
    "value": "Fire Token",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_stone_tablet_desc",
    "value": "The glyphs on this ancient tablet depict the temple's original founders as a human fire cult. Pretty hot bunch!",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_stone_tablet_flavor",
    "value": ""Where there is no temple there shall be no homes."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_orchid",
    "value": "Radiant Orchid",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_orchid_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "See Yarrow",
    },
    "value": "Having constantly soaked up contaminated slush from battered pipes, the Yarrow flora has mutated. Some nocturnal creatures have had a hard time adapting to this ruptured circadian rhythm.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_orchid_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "carbon dating pun= determin how old things are",
    },
    "value": ""Great gift when you've just started carbon dating."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_manual",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Pun on swedish brand IKEA",
    },
    "value": "INCREA Product Manual",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_manual_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "You never seem to get all the parts you need.",
    },
    "value": "This build-it-yourself apparatus used to be essential for enhancing mining equipment. The name printed on the device sounded either like nonsensical drivel or a curse from a cold, northern kingdom.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_manual_flavor",
    "value": ""The 30-day return policy excludes free shipping, but includes a complimentary smirk."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_pills",
    "value": "Yellow Pills",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_pills_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Doktor Schwester - A pun because it would be like saying Doctor Nurse.",
    },
    "value": "Yellow and small, just like pills should look. The handwritten prescription simply says: Doktor Schwester - and displays a thumbs up.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_pills_flavor",
    "value": ""Just what the doctor ordered."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_painting",
    "value": "Still life, still hope",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_painting_desc",
    "value": "Would you say that this painting is emotions processed through a moment of creative thought, or just that it's fine? Either way, a world without art would be a pale and pitiful place to live.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_painting_flavor",
    "value": ""The Earth without art is just eh."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_six_pack",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Moon Juice is like moon shine homemade booze but we can't say it's that.",
    },
    "value": "Six-Pack o' Moon Juice",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_six_pack_desc",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "caddywompus = crazy",
    },
    "value": "A shiner's wet (!) dream. Two things are for sure: they sure are crazy for it but they'd also surely be caddywhompus without it. Surely-durely!",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_six_pack_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "It looks like alcohol but we can't say that it's alcohol.",
    },
    "value": ""Better than the stuff it looks like."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_building_plans",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*DEMO*",
    },
    "value": "Rejected Building Plans",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_building_plans_desc",
    "value": "Someone sure got creative when turning this down. But then again, would you rather have (a) a house built on a fault line that will surely crush your dreams when you least expect it, or (b) a pretty darn good origami ostrich?",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_building_plans_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Spoof on No Woman No Cry (Bob Marley song)",
    },
    "value": ""No building no cry – with regards from the El Machino Surveying Office."",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dumbells",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Dumbbells = weight for training",
    },
    "value": "Rosie's Dumbbells",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dumbells_desc",
    "value": "A sense of weary muscles and hopes of less badgering lingers around these worn dumbbells.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_dumbells_flavor",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Nuttin' = Reference to nut, as in nuts and bolts.",
    },
    "value": ""Ain't nuttin' to it, but ta do it!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_completion_proof",
    "value": "Proof of Completion",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_completion_proof_desc",
    "value": "We apologize for the inconvenience.",
  },
  {
    "key": "collectible_completion_proof_flavor",
    "value": ""As they say in good old Sweden: De ska va gôtt å gräva!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_pre",
    "value": ">",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_post",
    "value": "_",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_trespasser_text_1",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Error message. Translate only actual words. Keep approximate length between \\n.",
    },
    "value": "SURGE BOOT: INITIATING THREAT ANALYSIS\\n\\nDIRECTIVE A, B, COMPILED.  #8F000025.28C40A8\\nVCT_SYSTEM_OFFLINE\\nAX=000A DIRECTIVE A: BLUE SAVIOR, FAIL LEVEL: CRITICAL BX=7FFF SP=000007C4\\nCX=0000 PRE-LOAD DIRECTIVE B: MOON ESCAPE DX=7FFF IP=0800F108\\nEX=6060 FX=7FFF XP=080FFFAA\\nBACK-UP COMPLETED\\nSPACE CAPSULE: SECURE\\n\\n\\nERROR RESULT:",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_trespasser_text_2",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Part of the error message. Translate.",
    },
    "value": "ANOMALY DETECTED",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_final_text",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": " Part of the error message. Translate. Preserve \\n. Keep approximate length between \\n.",
    },
    "value": "DISASTER PROTOCOL\\nDIRECTIVE A: BLUE SAVIOR\\nINITIATED",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_hell_bedrock_01",
    "value": "TEST RESULT:\\nTEST SUBJECT PRESSED 3 BUTTONS\\nTEST SUBJECT EXPECTS A...REWARD...?\\n\\nREWARD INITIATED:\\n......o..o..o......\\n......I..I..I......\\n....(VVVVVVVVV)....\\n....l--.--.--.l....\\n....l.--.--.--l....\\n....l_________l....\\n...................\\n\\nOBSERVATION:\\nTEST SUBJECT ENJOYED THE REWARD\\n\\nEXPECTATION: \\nCONTINUED MINIMAL SIGNS OF INTELLIGENCE\\n",
  },
  {
    "key": "message_hell_bedrock_02",
    "value": "TEST SUBJECT INITIATED ESCAPE\\n\\nTEST SESSION: STOPPED\\n\\n\\nDEACTIVATE TEST CHAMBER\\n\\nALSO: HIDE THE CAKE",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_english",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "English",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_spanish",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Español",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_portuguese",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Português",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_italian",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Italiano",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_german",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Deutsch",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_french",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Français",
  },
  {
    "key": "language_russian",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "Do not translate",
    },
    "value": "Русский",
