    "value": ""Одним махом семерых разбивахом!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrade_jackhammer_slower_winddown",
    "metadata": {
      "raw": "*NEW* Slow Hand – Eric Claptons nickname, quote is flavor from his song "Going down slow": I feel like I'm going, I'm going down slow.",
